OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold, slightly frosty
OL,6,Fmorning. A bright day, though the
OL,7,Fsunshine will be partially shielded by
OL,8,Fcloud at times. A moderate breeze from
OL,9,Fthe east and it will feel cold, with
OL,10,Ftemperatures close to average for the
OL,11,Ftime of year.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThe breeze will ease to bring
OL,14,Fa calm, dry and largely clear night.
OL,15,FTemperatures will fall sharply to
OL,16,Fallow a widespread frost to develop,
OL,17,Fcolder than on Saturday night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
