OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA calm and frosty morning.
OL,6,FThough there will be sunny spells, the
OL,7,Fsunshine will often be dimmed by high-
OL,8,Fcloud. Dry and cold throughout the day
OL,9,Fand breezy in the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FWet
OL,12,Fand windy during Tuesday with heavy
OL,13,Fburst and gales, mainly over hills.
OL,14,FRain and wind easing on Wednesday but
OL,15,Fstill cold and cloudy. On Thursday,
OL,16,Fdry with bright spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
